    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You radiate malignant power tied to one of the Dead Three. When you use Bloodthirst and teleport, each creature of your choice within 10 feet of either the space you left or your destination space (your choice) takes damage equal to your Intelligence modifier, of the damage type of the Resistance granted by your Dread Allegiance. Damage dealt by this feature ignores Resistance.</p>",
